        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hard coal briquette, burned in stove 5-15kW (proj. 210)</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hard coal briquette, burned in stove 5-15kW (proj. 210)
adapted from ecoinvent v2.0, with modification in order to express the heat as the upper heating value. This dataset is based on the input of fuel with a lower heating value of 31.4 MJ per kg;
UUID: 76105a46-57dc-327e-bf2e-5c6986b123af
House heating. The module describes the combustion process and includes coal transport and ash disposal.
Location: German conditions.
Technology: Average used in early 1990s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_76105a46-57dc-327e-bf2e-5c6986b123af.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
